00:00:55.823 --> 00:00:56.843
Fuck, bro.

00:00:57.805 --> 00:00:59.670
- I mean actually like,

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:03.300
I have recently started
to stretch every day

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.530
after work, like just, just at home,

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:06.455
like, you know,

00:01:06.455 --> 00:01:08.120
I would go home and just
do like really simple,

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.355
like 10 to 15 minute,
like, stretch exercises.

00:01:10.355 --> 00:01:11.188
- How did it start?

00:01:11.188 --> 00:01:12.900
- Well, it started because

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.130
I found myself sitting at my desk all day

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.430
