of you, but, you know,

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.220
I can't make fun of you
if you're taking care of

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:27.053
yourself.

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:27.886
- Exactly.

00:01:27.886 --> 00:01:28.719
And you can't make fun of a friend

00:01:28.719 --> 00:01:29.860
