00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.680
I think, like, I think to myself, "Nah,

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.410
I'm not, I'm not that, at that stage yet"

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.367
But then I realize next
month I'm 27, I'm like,

00:01:40.367 --> 00:01:42.240
"You know what? I'm kind
of getting to that stage.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.624
I should probably start while I'm ahead,

00:01:44.624 --> 00:01:46.010
to just like fix my shit

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:47.330
before it gets too messed up"

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:49.290
