00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:51.330
especially when you're just
in your fucking twenties,

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.880
you just don't give a shit about this.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:53.890
I mean, why would you?

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:56.060
You never feel any effects on your body.

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:58.717
- You do shit that your
body was not built to do.

00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:00.780
- And you don't realize this, but like,

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.400
you don't realize this
until you get, like,

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.870
that kind of time, period of your life

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:06.037
comes to an end, that you just realize,

00:02:06.037 --> 00:02:07.940
"Man, that's a, that's a really short

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.540
time period of my life, and I've just got

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.210
the rest of my life now having
to live with this problem

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:14.440
because I just didn't
fucking take care of it"

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.270
So yeah. Take care of your body.

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:18.880
Like, if there's one thing
that I've definitely paid

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:20.930
attention to, especially, like,

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:22.943
it doesn't matter if you're a YouTuber

00:02:22.943 --> 00:02:24.060
or you're just at an office job,

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:26.260
somewhere where you're sitting at a desk

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:27.740
for long periods of time, please,

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:28.820
please,

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:30.139
Google "ergonomics"

00:02:30.139 --> 00:02:30.972
(Joey laughs)

00:02:30.972 --> 00:02:31.805
It's really fucking important,

00:02:31.805 --> 00:02:33.470
and it's a really boring word,

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:34.880
but, my God, like.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:35.713
